# NOTE: Build context for this Dockerfile is `backend/` (the parent
# directory), not `backend/write-api/`. This .dockerignore lives next to
# the Dockerfile because some tooling reads it from there — but the
# authoritative .dockerignore for the backend context is also kept in
# sync at `backend/.dockerignore` (created lazily on first build).
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/TestResults/
**/.idea/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/.claude/
**/dev_env/
**/testing/
**/docs/
**/infrastructure/
